WEBVTT

00:00:18.051 --> 00:00:22.088
Though you are so close,
Kore hodo soba ni

00:00:22.088 --> 00:00:26.593
I cannot tell you how I feel.
Iru no ni tsutaerarezu

00:00:26.593 --> 00:00:30.663
The more strongly I feel,
Tsuyoku omou hodo

00:00:30.663 --> 00:00:35.268
the harder it is for me to find the words.
Kotoba ga mitsukaranai

00:00:35.268 --> 00:00:43.309
What is sad is not fate...
Kanashii no wa unmei ja nakute

00:00:43.309 --> 00:00:54.083
...but that all encounters come to an end.
Deai no subete ni owari ga aru koto

00:00:54.487 --> 00:00:58.525
O incomplete beings,
Mikan naru mono

00:00:58.525 --> 00:01:02.962
awaken, for beyond the night...
mezameyo yoru o koetara

00:01:02.962 --> 00:01:07.033
At the end of the desert...
Sabaku no hate ni

00:01:07.033 --> 00:01:14.701
...the truth surely awaits you.
Shinjitsu ga matteru yo kitto

00:01:43.403 --> 00:01:44.461
Hono...

00:01:55.615 --> 00:01:56.479
This is...

00:01:56.716 --> 00:01:57.410
What is it?

00:01:58.651 --> 00:02:02.985
This liquid has the ability to bolster
the regenerative power of cells...

00:02:03.323 --> 00:02:07.555
...and to maybe even serve as
a replacement for lost cells.

00:02:07.861 --> 00:02:09.829
You're saying they're regenerative cells?

00:02:10.363 --> 00:02:11.091
Yes.

00:02:11.498 --> 00:02:14.300
Perhaps it has genetic information built into it,

00:02:14.300 --> 00:02:16.870
which allows it to bypass the immune
function that would normally fight it.

00:02:16.870 --> 00:02:17.802
Impossible...

00:02:18.404 --> 00:02:19.962
A perfect life form...

00:02:20.039 --> 00:02:21.370
Oh, she moved!

00:02:22.041 --> 00:02:23.872
Hono's hand moved!

00:02:29.482 --> 00:02:30.506
Her color...

00:02:30.650 --> 00:02:31.251
Life Dancing Wildly

00:02:31.251 --> 00:02:32.418
Life Dancing Wildly
...is returning.

00:02:32.418 --> 00:02:35.512
Life Dancing Wildly

00:02:51.171 --> 00:02:52.138
Where...

00:02:52.505 --> 00:02:53.767
Where are you going?

00:02:55.275 --> 00:02:57.140
Where life lives.

00:02:58.511 --> 00:03:00.035
And that's not here?

00:03:00.580 --> 00:03:02.605
This is your place.

00:03:03.249 --> 00:03:05.046
Where you are to live.

00:03:05.518 --> 00:03:07.720
Where I am to live?

00:03:07.720 --> 00:03:08.687
Yes.

00:03:09.756 --> 00:03:13.593
But you're going to carry the seed of life...

00:03:13.593 --> 00:03:15.288
...and leave this planet, aren't you?

00:03:16.296 --> 00:03:19.595
I refuse to believe that this
planet is coming to an end.

00:03:20.099 --> 00:03:20.793
But...

00:03:21.000 --> 00:03:21.932
No.

00:03:23.303 --> 00:03:26.136
This planet is overflowing with life.

00:03:26.606 --> 00:03:28.641
The place where you are to live...

00:03:28.641 --> 00:03:31.235
...is also being watched over
by precious life, isn't it?

00:03:33.046 --> 00:03:34.980
So let's live on.

00:03:36.282 --> 00:03:37.510
I want to keep living...

00:03:39.185 --> 00:03:40.482
I do want to keep living!

00:03:43.590 --> 00:03:46.058
As long as I'm alive, someday, once again...

00:03:54.834 --> 00:03:55.562
Millie.

00:03:57.904 --> 00:03:58.632
Millie.

00:04:00.373 --> 00:04:01.305
What?

00:04:02.575 --> 00:04:04.668
You should get some rest now.

00:04:05.411 --> 00:04:06.742
What about you?

00:04:07.146 --> 00:04:10.883
I shall wait until Miss Honoka wakes up.

00:04:10.883 --> 00:04:11.941
Then, me too!

00:04:12.385 --> 00:04:13.010
What?

00:04:16.189 --> 00:04:17.918
Say, Iks?

00:04:18.591 --> 00:04:19.319
Yes?

00:04:20.293 --> 00:04:22.818
Do you love Hono?

00:04:23.129 --> 00:04:23.686
What?

00:04:24.130 --> 00:04:25.654
I love her.

00:04:26.032 --> 00:04:29.402
She's so kind and yet, she's so strong.

00:04:29.402 --> 00:04:31.597
And she's always so earnest.

00:04:32.171 --> 00:04:33.468
That is true.

00:04:35.942 --> 00:04:37.705
I wonder why...

00:04:38.244 --> 00:04:40.546
It's not for herself,

00:04:40.546 --> 00:04:43.572
so why is it that she can push
herself until she gets like this?

00:04:53.926 --> 00:04:56.394
I wonder if it's wrong to push yourself...

00:04:57.297 --> 00:05:02.894
I wonder if it's wrong for me
to want to be like Hono...

00:05:12.345 --> 00:05:14.210
He wants to go somewhere.

00:05:14.714 --> 00:05:16.579
It seems he wants you to come with him.

00:05:16.849 --> 00:05:17.406
Where?

00:05:18.084 --> 00:05:19.711
That, even I cannot tell.

00:05:20.520 --> 00:05:23.455
But I don't think you can
go wrong in trusting him.

00:05:24.257 --> 00:05:28.591
Iks, I feel the same as you now, but...

00:05:28.861 --> 00:05:34.163
It seems Millie reminds Kamui
of a sweet warmth from his past.

00:05:34.567 --> 00:05:37.170
He would never endanger her.

00:05:37.170 --> 00:05:38.933
A sweet past...

00:05:39.572 --> 00:05:42.769
Kamui once lived with humans.

00:05:43.309 --> 00:05:45.402
With a family that had a little girl like Millie.

00:05:46.713 --> 00:05:50.012
A fond memory of gentle warmth...

00:05:50.950 --> 00:05:53.686
It is difficult to read his mind,

00:05:53.686 --> 00:05:56.985
but that memory alone was left out in the open.

00:05:57.857 --> 00:06:01.816
So that he himself could
easily recall it at any time.

00:06:01.961 --> 00:06:04.327
Is that why you saved me?

00:06:06.866 --> 00:06:09.562
Kamui, take me with you.

00:06:10.370 --> 00:06:11.564
Bogie, it's okay, right?

00:06:12.905 --> 00:06:15.874
The sandstorm seems to have abated at least...

00:06:42.735 --> 00:06:44.032
This is... the place?

00:06:45.905 --> 00:06:48.874
Is there something here?

00:06:59.986 --> 00:07:01.613
A full moon night.

00:07:02.088 --> 00:07:05.421
Tiny insects were departing from their nests...

00:07:13.065 --> 00:07:15.966
A dragonfly... A moonlight dragonfly?

00:07:45.698 --> 00:07:49.361
It was a wild dance for them to
share a fleeting moment of love.

00:07:50.570 --> 00:07:53.334
The high point in the course of their short lives.

00:07:58.511 --> 00:08:03.346
Millie marveled that such a beautiful
sight existed in this world.

00:08:04.917 --> 00:08:08.375
Her heart trembled so that
she almost wanted to shout,

00:08:09.622 --> 00:08:10.714
and then...

00:08:16.562 --> 00:08:18.757
You've smiled for me, Millie.

00:08:22.635 --> 00:08:23.795
Hono?

00:08:26.739 --> 00:08:28.104
Hono!

00:08:32.411 --> 00:08:35.380
The impulse to think, "How?"
Lasted only a moment.

00:08:36.382 --> 00:08:41.877
It was almost inexplicable how readily
Millie accepted Honoka's presence.

00:08:44.357 --> 00:08:45.881
Life is dancing about.

00:08:47.260 --> 00:08:49.524
Because they all want to live...

00:08:50.129 --> 00:08:53.496
That's why it's beautiful and sad.

00:08:54.500 --> 00:08:57.367
I've always wanted to show this to you.

00:08:58.237 --> 00:08:59.898
Thank you, Hono.

00:09:00.740 --> 00:09:03.843
I'm really, really happy.

00:09:03.843 --> 00:09:06.471
I have you and Kamui to thank.

00:09:09.649 --> 00:09:11.048
Hono?

00:09:16.489 --> 00:09:17.649
Millie...

00:09:21.193 --> 00:09:22.455
Welcome back.

00:09:35.708 --> 00:09:37.869
Say that again for me, Honoka?

00:09:38.110 --> 00:09:41.409
I said, we're not going back to Emporium.

00:09:42.148 --> 00:09:46.419
He... Leon is still after the Fairy and Kamui.

00:09:46.419 --> 00:09:48.321
And what do you mean to do about it?

00:09:48.321 --> 00:09:50.312
Are you saying you intend to fight him again?

00:09:51.824 --> 00:09:52.791
That's absurd.

00:09:53.092 --> 00:09:55.652
It was only yesterday that he almost killed you.

00:09:55.828 --> 00:09:59.821
You think you can do something
about him in your weakened state?!

00:10:00.099 --> 00:10:01.566
I might not be able to...

00:10:02.101 --> 00:10:07.807
But both Kamui and the Fairy have
saved Millie and saved me.

00:10:07.807 --> 00:10:09.475
I can't turn a blind eye to that...

00:10:09.475 --> 00:10:11.443
And you can repay them by dying?!

00:10:14.013 --> 00:10:16.048
Let me ask you one more time.

00:10:16.048 --> 00:10:18.551
You have no chance of winning
against this opponent...

00:10:18.551 --> 00:10:20.382
...and you would still fight him?

00:10:20.853 --> 00:10:22.616
What meaning is there in doing that?!

00:10:25.291 --> 00:10:26.121
I, too...

00:10:26.959 --> 00:10:29.951
I, too, believe what Mr. Bogie
is saying is correct.

00:10:31.130 --> 00:10:33.257
You're saying I should go home...

00:10:35.501 --> 00:10:36.627
Iks...

00:10:37.370 --> 00:10:41.397
I want to help the Fairy and Kamui.

00:10:41.874 --> 00:10:42.772
Millie...

00:10:43.409 --> 00:10:45.377
I love you, Hono.

00:10:45.878 --> 00:10:51.009
I want to be with you and I don't
ever want you to get hurt,

00:10:51.384 --> 00:10:52.874
but... but see...

00:10:53.753 --> 00:10:56.119
You're you.

00:10:56.522 --> 00:10:58.854
I like you when you're being yourself,

00:10:59.892 --> 00:11:00.881
so...

00:11:01.327 --> 00:11:03.887
Millie, thank you.

00:11:06.098 --> 00:11:07.633
That's two against two.

00:11:07.633 --> 00:11:08.361
No.

00:11:09.101 --> 00:11:10.659
Please make that three against one.

00:11:11.003 --> 00:11:12.204
Iks...

00:11:12.204 --> 00:11:13.796
What's the meaning of this?

00:11:13.939 --> 00:11:17.136
Where in this conversation was a
reason for you to change your mind?

00:11:17.343 --> 00:11:19.504
Pardon me. It's just that...

00:11:19.945 --> 00:11:21.310
Just what?

00:11:22.014 --> 00:11:24.539
Just that my thinking changed.

00:11:24.717 --> 00:11:27.153
You can only be so illogical about this.

00:11:27.153 --> 00:11:28.711
Please understand, Bogie!

00:11:28.888 --> 00:11:31.413
Just eating and sleeping
isn't what living is about.

00:11:32.324 --> 00:11:35.157
If we turned back now,
that's what it'd amount to!

00:11:36.796 --> 00:11:41.256
It doesn't look like my lone opposition
is going to overturn any opinions.

00:11:41.434 --> 00:11:44.198
In that case, I have one condition.

00:11:44.670 --> 00:11:45.728
Condition?

00:11:46.005 --> 00:11:47.700
Fight in the PSP.

00:11:47.873 --> 00:11:51.468
At the very least,
it'll protect you from his attacks.

00:11:51.777 --> 00:11:55.213
But the Dragon Buster won't
be effective against him...

00:11:55.381 --> 00:11:56.609
You're saying that now?

00:11:56.982 --> 00:11:58.984
What would be effective against him?

00:11:58.984 --> 00:12:02.154
Not being mortally wounded has
to be your priority above all else.

00:12:02.154 --> 00:12:04.523
You talk about how to live your life,

00:12:04.523 --> 00:12:06.492
but you can't have that discussion...

00:12:06.492 --> 00:12:08.551
...if you aren't actually alive, can you?!

00:12:10.029 --> 00:12:13.556
I only want you to stay alive.

00:12:14.867 --> 00:12:15.925
Bogie...

00:12:23.743 --> 00:12:26.576
Watching Honoka give her
all in her search for Leon,

00:12:27.480 --> 00:12:29.744
everyone's feelings were mixed.

00:12:31.117 --> 00:12:32.448
The truth was,

00:12:32.551 --> 00:12:34.246
in their heart of hearts,

00:12:34.587 --> 00:12:38.148
everyone except Honoka was praying
they would not run into Leon.

00:12:41.060 --> 00:12:43.324
Several days passed this way.

00:12:43.729 --> 00:12:46.165
Just as Bogie was beginning to think...

00:12:46.165 --> 00:12:48.395
...that he ought to urge her to head home again...

00:12:48.601 --> 00:12:50.626
Bogie, set course to the northeast!

00:12:51.103 --> 00:12:51.967
You found him?

00:12:52.805 --> 00:12:53.635
I feel him...

00:12:55.608 --> 00:12:57.508
Bogie, halt the engine.

00:13:03.783 --> 00:13:04.681
There.

00:13:05.117 --> 00:13:06.311
Zoom in on the screen.

00:13:09.321 --> 00:13:10.219
Leon!

00:13:12.424 --> 00:13:13.584
He's going after Kamui!

00:13:18.898 --> 00:13:19.865
Miss Honoka!

00:13:21.367 --> 00:13:24.670
If there comes a time when
Honoka is defeated by Leon,

00:13:24.670 --> 00:13:27.161
I will kill him, even if I have to self-destruct!

00:13:28.741 --> 00:13:30.265
Miss Honoka will not lose.

00:13:30.743 --> 00:13:33.473
Even if she cannot win, she will never lose.

00:13:39.819 --> 00:13:43.255
Kamui, I'll take care of this guy. You go on.

00:13:43.589 --> 00:13:45.991
You surprise me, Sword Dancer.

00:13:45.991 --> 00:13:48.482
What's that thing? A mobile coffin?

00:13:48.761 --> 00:13:50.830
Too bad for you, I'm not dead.

00:13:50.830 --> 00:13:52.491
Sorry to dash your hopes.

00:13:53.465 --> 00:13:55.433
Not at all. It's exactly as I'd hoped.

00:13:57.503 --> 00:13:58.197
Go!

00:13:59.171 --> 00:14:00.365
I'll be fine.

00:14:03.475 --> 00:14:06.308
I'm so happy to see you again, Sword Dancer.

00:14:06.612 --> 00:14:09.081
For a long time, I wasn't
able to find an opponent...

00:14:09.081 --> 00:14:10.912
...that I could truly enjoy fighting.

00:14:11.383 --> 00:14:13.374
Not even during that war...

00:14:13.552 --> 00:14:16.487
So you really are a remnant
of the Monster Troop...

00:14:16.689 --> 00:14:18.350
I didn't expect you to know that.

00:14:18.591 --> 00:14:20.559
That simplifies things.

00:14:38.043 --> 00:14:41.877
Looks like you still have your agility,
even in that getup.

00:14:42.081 --> 00:14:43.173
I wouldn't have it any other way!

00:14:52.491 --> 00:14:53.515
I can't move!

00:14:56.262 --> 00:14:58.787
He's melting it? No, he's infiltrating it!

00:15:01.734 --> 00:15:02.496
Leon!

00:15:03.302 --> 00:15:05.532
Why don't you come on out, Sword Dancer?

00:15:05.971 --> 00:15:09.498
That is, if you don't want this to
really turn into your coffin.

00:15:12.678 --> 00:15:16.011
Sword Dancer, show me your last dance!

00:15:23.756 --> 00:15:25.189
Millie, where are you going?!

00:15:27.192 --> 00:15:27.681
Millie!

00:15:30.562 --> 00:15:31.597
Let me go!

00:15:31.597 --> 00:15:34.361
I'm... I'm going to go help Honoka!

00:15:34.500 --> 00:15:36.161
You won't be able to help her with a gun!

00:15:36.435 --> 00:15:39.004
I know! I know that, but still!

00:15:39.004 --> 00:15:40.995
You wish to become like Miss Honoka, correct?

00:15:41.240 --> 00:15:43.174
Strong and kind like Miss Honoka.

00:15:43.442 --> 00:15:45.077
That's right! That's why...

00:15:45.077 --> 00:15:48.740
If so, let's quietly watch
over her from where we are.

00:15:48.814 --> 00:15:49.576
What?

00:15:50.983 --> 00:15:54.219
Even if you do not have the
strength to help someone,

00:15:54.219 --> 00:15:57.211
you can watch over them and be there for them.

00:15:57.790 --> 00:16:02.750
At times, that can give great strength
to those being watched over.

00:16:03.195 --> 00:16:04.184
Give strength?

00:16:04.863 --> 00:16:08.167
If Miss Honoka were in your shoes,
that is what she would do.

00:16:08.167 --> 00:16:10.692
She would be herself, never overreaching...

00:16:32.558 --> 00:16:34.492
What are you just standing there for?

00:16:34.727 --> 00:16:36.285
Still a recovering invalid, after all?

00:16:43.736 --> 00:16:45.499
The voice of the wind...

00:16:58.350 --> 00:17:01.553
I can't complain after the
fun you've let me have.

00:17:01.553 --> 00:17:02.952
You've got my thanks,

00:17:03.956 --> 00:17:05.924
Sword Dancer!

00:17:08.694 --> 00:17:09.217
What?

00:17:09.695 --> 00:17:10.389
The laser...

00:17:10.763 --> 00:17:11.695
She dodged it!

00:17:14.299 --> 00:17:19.635
Naturally, even Honoka cannot
match the speed of light.

00:17:20.672 --> 00:17:22.196
What Honoka was looking at was...

00:17:22.307 --> 00:17:27.040
...the disturbance in Leon's chi the
moment he consciously fired a shot.

00:17:33.886 --> 00:17:36.081
I-Impossible!

00:17:47.900 --> 00:17:50.767
Wh-What did you do?

00:17:52.337 --> 00:17:56.740
You cut through me, Sword Dancer?

00:17:58.644 --> 00:18:01.772
Just as... I thought...

00:18:02.381 --> 00:18:06.374
Having the chance to fight you was...

00:18:07.352 --> 00:18:09.149
What she cut through...

00:18:09.221 --> 00:18:13.157
...was the network of nanomachines
spanning throughout Leon's body.

00:18:14.393 --> 00:18:17.129
Cutting through the very
signals being transmitted,

00:18:17.129 --> 00:18:20.098
she completely blocked even
their ability to regenerate.

00:18:25.137 --> 00:18:27.264
How was she able to do such a thing?

00:18:27.573 --> 00:18:30.041
Honoka did not know right then.

00:18:31.410 --> 00:18:36.074
Merely, she felt as though
the entirety of the world...

00:18:36.949 --> 00:18:40.009
...had spoken to her whole being,
so clearly as to be transparent.

00:18:41.854 --> 00:18:43.446
Hono!

00:18:44.156 --> 00:18:45.623
Hono!

00:18:45.724 --> 00:18:46.349
Miss Honoka!

00:18:51.063 --> 00:18:51.961
Millie...

00:18:52.764 --> 00:18:53.423
Iks...

00:18:54.600 --> 00:18:55.794
Hono!

00:18:56.735 --> 00:18:57.997
Thank you, Millie.

00:18:58.370 --> 00:19:01.203
What? I didn't do anything...

00:19:01.507 --> 00:19:03.975
I couldn't do anything,
just like I knew I couldn't.

00:19:04.743 --> 00:19:07.279
Because I knew the whole time...

00:19:07.279 --> 00:19:09.804
...that you were watching over me.

00:19:10.182 --> 00:19:13.640
Because I knew that, I was able to fight.

00:19:14.019 --> 00:19:15.316
Hono...

00:19:20.192 --> 00:19:21.181
Kamui...

00:19:21.994 --> 00:19:23.154
The Fairy!

00:19:27.633 --> 00:19:28.930
I have been waiting.

00:19:29.601 --> 00:19:30.727
I have been waiting for this.

00:19:41.280 --> 00:19:43.805
Where's Kamui?
Where did Kamui and the Fairy go?

00:19:44.249 --> 00:19:45.614
They became one.

00:19:46.485 --> 00:19:47.679
One?

00:19:47.753 --> 00:19:50.745
The Fairy must have been missing something...

00:19:52.057 --> 00:19:54.753
...and he must have had that
vital piece of missing genes.

00:19:55.928 --> 00:19:59.264
In her preparation to depart from this planet,

00:19:59.264 --> 00:20:01.733
the Fairy had a need to
become one with Kamui...

00:20:01.733 --> 00:20:05.032
...and Kamui was searching for
the Fairy because he knew this.

00:20:06.471 --> 00:20:08.996
Did she depart? The Fairy?

00:20:10.008 --> 00:20:13.068
She has yet to find the place
where she can depart from.

00:20:13.212 --> 00:20:16.648
She will probably wander
this land for a while longer.

00:20:16.848 --> 00:20:18.179
As a legend.

00:20:18.850 --> 00:20:22.581
I was always being helped along by Kamui...

00:20:22.688 --> 00:20:24.349
That is not true.

00:20:24.856 --> 00:20:26.517
Kamui understood.

00:20:26.892 --> 00:20:29.588
That you were trying to protect him from Leon.

00:20:30.696 --> 00:20:32.323
It brought joy to Kamui as well.

00:20:32.731 --> 00:20:35.667
That during this long and solitary
journey in his search for the Fairy,

00:20:35.667 --> 00:20:37.302
even if it was only for a brief time,

00:20:37.302 --> 00:20:41.796
he had people like you and Millie,
who would watch over him.

00:20:43.575 --> 00:20:44.610
Hono.

00:20:44.610 --> 00:20:45.838
Huh? What's up?

00:20:46.778 --> 00:20:48.336
I'm going to return this.

00:20:48.714 --> 00:20:49.646
Why?

00:20:50.082 --> 00:20:53.449
The truth is, I thought of this as an amulet.

00:20:53.752 --> 00:20:57.848
That if I had this, maybe I could
feel like I'm together with you.

00:20:58.423 --> 00:21:02.860
But in the end, something like
this can't take your place.

00:21:04.263 --> 00:21:05.355
Of course it can't.

00:21:06.565 --> 00:21:09.193
Do you remember the moonlight dragonflies?

00:21:09.701 --> 00:21:10.969
The ones we watched together?

00:21:10.969 --> 00:21:13.870
I knew it! You were there with me, weren't you?!

00:21:14.373 --> 00:21:15.840
I always am.

00:21:16.408 --> 00:21:20.445
I mean, you're always with me, too.

00:21:20.445 --> 00:21:21.377
Didn't you know that?

00:21:21.747 --> 00:21:23.009
Hono...

00:21:24.216 --> 00:21:25.376
I love you!

00:21:29.288 --> 00:21:31.381
In the desert, there are legends.

00:21:32.090 --> 00:21:34.388
In the desert and on this planet,

00:21:35.360 --> 00:21:37.521
as long as life goes on,

00:21:38.630 --> 00:21:40.757
legends will continue to be born.

00:21:52.744 --> 00:21:56.214
An intersection waiting for morning...
Asa o matteiru kousaten ga

00:21:56.214 --> 00:22:00.218
...cradling an abandoned cat that wandered in.
Mayoikonda sute-neko o daiteiru

00:22:00.218 --> 00:22:02.821
Red and green and yellow.
Aka to ao to kiiro

00:22:02.821 --> 00:22:05.722
It is simply gentle.
Sore wa tada yasashii

00:22:06.458 --> 00:22:09.928
Stopping just after dawn,
Akegata-sugi ni furiyanda

00:22:09.928 --> 00:22:13.965
a misty rain made a screen of water.
Kosame ga tsukutta mizu no sukuriin ga

00:22:13.965 --> 00:22:16.501
Until that time when it dries,
Kawaku sono toki made

00:22:16.501 --> 00:22:19.470
it is simply gentle.
Sore wa tada yasashii

00:22:19.705 --> 00:22:23.208
More than small coincidences like that,
Sonna chiisana guuzen yori mo

00:22:23.208 --> 00:22:26.611
the fact that you are there...
Kimi ga soko ni iru koto ga

00:22:26.611 --> 00:22:30.082
...cannot be a small thing, I think.
Chiisai hazu ga nai to omounda

00:22:30.082 --> 00:22:33.677
Even though it's obvious.
Atarimae nandakedo

00:22:35.387 --> 00:22:42.160
It must be sad not to have anyone.
Daremo inai to kanashii koto deshou

00:22:42.160 --> 00:22:49.101
Now, come on out to where the sun is shining.
Saa hi no ataru basho e dete-oide

00:22:49.101 --> 00:22:55.941
Even the several incidents that trouble you...
Kimi o komaraseru ikutsuka no dekigoto mo

00:22:55.941 --> 00:23:00.878
...are coincidences of yesterdays past.
Kinou izen no guuzen nanda yo

00:23:02.781 --> 00:23:07.616
Though, I'm sure you actually know that already.
Hontou wa wakatteru to omou kedo

00:23:15.127 --> 00:23:16.856
Preview

00:23:17.095 --> 00:23:20.030
Fila Marique of The Third came to see me.

00:23:20.499 --> 00:23:23.627
The job is to rescue Joganki.

00:23:24.035 --> 00:23:28.096
But she's attacked by autonomous
soldiers right before my eyes.

00:23:28.573 --> 00:23:31.906
Could this possibly be a war
between factions of The Third?

00:23:32.477 --> 00:23:35.537
Something about this job smells fishy to me.

00:23:36.248 --> 00:23:37.112
But...

00:23:37.816 --> 00:23:40.886
Next time on
The Third - The Girl With The Blue Eye,

00:23:40.886 --> 00:23:42.020
episode 17, "Rona Fauna".

00:23:42.020 --> 00:23:43.355
Rona Fauna
episode 17, "Rona Fauna".

00:23:43.355 --> 00:23:44.879
Rona Fauna
